{"header":{"status":{"name":"Success","code":0,"description":"Query success","apiHelp":"https://www.censtatd.gov.hk/en/web_table.html?id=660-78001&api_popup=1"},"title":"Operating characteristics of enterprises analysed by sector (only including companies with employees), 2018 - 2024","tablenote":["For detailed statistics on the operating characteristics of enterprises of 2008-2017, please refer to Table 660-78001A.","In this table, small and medium enterprises refer to those companies with fewer than 50 persons engaged.","Fast food cafes do not include takeaway shops.","Estate management, security and cleaning services do not include membership organisations.","Security services include investigation activities, pest control services as well as landscape care and greenery services.","In calculating figures for total receipts and profit of elderly homes, subsidies from government and other organisations were also included.","The 5th term of Minimum Wage Commission (2019-2021), in reviewing the coverage of the \"Low-paying sectors\" (LPS), decided to include the subsector \"food services\" which was under \"other sectors\" as part of \"Restaurants\" sector under LPS, and name it as \"Other food and beverage services\". The \"Restaurants\" sector was also renamed to \"Food and beverage services\", with the coverage of subsectors increasing to five (i.e. \"Chinese restaurants\", \"Non-Chinese restaurants\", \"Fast food cafes\", \"Hong Kong style tea cafes\", and \"Other food and beverage services\"). Hence, Statistics from 2018 or later may not be strictly comparable to those on or before 2017.","Non-low-paying sectors are sectors other than those in (A) above.","Figures were rounded to tens.","Earnings before tax ratio (abbreviated as profit ratio) refers to ratio of profit before deducting tax; gain/loss on disposal of property, machinery and equipment; bad debts/write-off; provisions; etc.; to business receipts.","Not including those companies without business receipts and local representative offices of overseas companies.","[*2] Figure is not released due to precision consideration and/or in order to safeguard confidentiality of information of individual companies.","[*6] Figure is not released in order to safeguard confidentiality of information of individual companies.","[§34] Between (but not equal to) +/- 0.05%"],"source":"2018-2024 Annual Survey of Economic Activities Census and Statistics Department (Enquiry telephone no.: 3903 7247  Enquiry e-mail : ind-production@censtatd.gov.hk)","count":{"noOfRecords":45,"started":"2026-10-24T04:02:00+00:00","finished":"2026-10-24T04:02:00+00:00","durationSeconds":0.097627}},"dataSet":[{"IND":"ind_SMW_ASEA_2018_10-12","INDDesc":"4.5   Food processing and production","ENT":"ent_SMW_ALL","ENTDesc":"All enterprises with employees","freq":"Y","period":"2018","sv":"COMP_TO_TR","svDesc":"(%)","figure":17,"sd_value":""},{"IND":"ind_SMW_ASEA_2018_10-12","INDDesc":"4.5   Food processing and production","ENT":"SME","ENTDesc":"Small and medium enterprises with employees","freq":"Y","period":"2018","sv":"COMP_TO_TR","svDesc":"(%)","figure":16.5,"sd_value":""},{"IND":"ind_SMW_ASEA_2018_13-33","INDDesc":"5.    Manufacturing","ENT":"ent_SMW_ALL","ENTDesc":"All enterprises with employees","freq":"Y","period":"2018","sv":"COMP_TO_TR","svDesc":"(%)","figure":8,"sd_value":""},{"IND":"ind_SMW_ASEA_2018_45_46","INDDesc":"7.    Import/export trade and wholesale","ENT":"ent_SMW_ALL","ENTDesc":"All enterprises with employees","freq":"Y","period":"2018","sv":"COMP_TO_TR","svDesc":"(%)","figure":4.2,"sd_value":""},{"IND":"ind_SMW_ASEA_2018_47","INDDesc":"1.    Retail","ENT":"ent_SMW_ALL","ENTDesc":"All enterprises with employees","freq":"Y","period":"2018","sv":"COMP_TO_TR","svDesc":"(%)","figure":9.7,"sd_value":""},{"IND":"ind_SMW_ASEA_2018_47_OTH","INDDesc":"1.2   Other retail stores","ENT":"ent_SMW_ALL","ENTDesc":"All enterprises with employees","freq":"Y","period":"2018","sv":"COMP_TO_TR","svDesc":"(%)"